title: Workspace
description: Everything a signed-in member sees. A workspace's projects, members, and billing, and inside a project, its document tree, whiteboards, and pages.
connects:
  - to: src/components/tree
    label: project tree
  - to: src/components/whiteboard
    label: whiteboards
  - to: src/components/editor
    label: pages
  - to: src/lib/github
    label: Import from GitHub
  - to: src/lib/supabase
    label: queries as the member
    description: Routes and server actions query Supabase with the member's session. A viewer who calls an editor's action is refused by the database, not only by the interface.
  - to: src/app/api
    label: export API
    description: |
      Export project builds its zip in the browser, from two routes the member's session can read. Row-level security decides what comes back.

      ```yaml
      openapi: 3.1.0
      info: { title: Subcanvas export, version: "1" }
      paths:
        /api/projects/{projectId}/export:
          get:
            summary: The project's folders and documents, and where each goes in the zip
            responses:
              "200": { description: "{ project, layout: { folders, documents } }" }
              "404": { description: No such project, or you cannot read it }
        /api/projects/{projectId}/export/documents:
          get:
            summary: Some of its documents, converted
            parameters:
              - name: ids
                in: query
                required: true
                description: 1 to 50 document ids, comma-separated
            responses:
              "200":
                description: One JSON line per document, up to 4 MB an answer; ask again for the rest
                content:
                  application/x-ndjson:
                    schema:
                      oneOf:
                        - { title: Page, required: [id, type, title, markdown] }
                        - { title: Whiteboard, required: [id, type, title, svg, nodes, edges] }
                        - { title: Unreadable, required: [id, error] }
              "400": { description: Ask for 1 to 50 documents by id }
      ```
